OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrested over major fire at
OL,4,AFolkestone hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FA total of 90 people were relocated
OL,7,Ffrom neighbouring Pavilion Court in
OL,8,FMarine Terrace following concerns
OL,9,Fraised by safety inspectors, Folkestone
OL,10,Fand Hythe District Council said.
